<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">低语在耳边锈成风</text><text for="L2">黄昏捎来恐惧的破晓</text><text for="L3">风潮蚀尽天穹与日光</text><text for="L4">囚于阴翳之中 一座无垠黑夜构就的冢</text><text for="L5">让剑与风在掌心交响</text><text for="L6">任由命运席卷 我依旧唤起万钧灰烬</text><text for="L7">若自由必需穿过波涛</text><text for="L8">就把这顶冠冕熔作尘埃 向彼岸吹拂而去</text><text for="L9">任风潮重塑这副躯壳</text><text for="L10">随我迈向将临的曙光</text><text for="L11">当人们跪拜神像</text><text for="L12">我正逆风而上 力挽狂澜</text><text for="L13">抵挡黑夜的降临</text><text for="L14">狂风在我周遭环绕 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(在光芒万顷的风暴之中)</span></text><text for="L15">而我负意前行 撕裂天穹 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(抵挡黑夜的降临)</span></text><text for="L16">风潮愈烈 而我高唱炽热的战歌</text><text for="L17">我将找到出路 穿越那</text><text for="L18">风暴之眼</text><text for="L19">用目光眺望被囚禁的星辰</text><text for="L20">其微光孱弱 正如我以爱怀揣的祈愿一般</text><text for="L21">当往昔的阴霾沉入土壤</text><text for="L22">当灵魂的回响沉入深海</text><text for="L23">我会与你坚韧并肩于世界尽头</text><text for="L24">阻止光芒的消逝</text><text for="L25">狂风在我周遭环绕 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(在倾注光芒的风暴之中)</span></text><text for="L26">而我负意前行 撕裂天穹 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(抵挡黑夜的降临)</span></text><text for="L27">狂风愈烈 我引航孤舟奔赴光明</text><text for="L28">我们将冲破风暴</text><text for="L29">穿越那风暴之眼</text><text for="L30">我会伫立</text><text for="L31">我会等待</text><text for="L32">在世界的尽头</text><text for="L33">我会等待</text><text for="L34">任时光消逝</text><text for="L35">在世界的尽头</text><text for="L36">等鸢尾绽放</text><text for="L37">任风潮重塑这副躯壳</text><text for="L38">随我迈向将临的曙光</text><text for="L39">当人们跪拜神像</text><text for="L40">我正逆风而上 力挽狂澜</text><text for="L41">狂风在我周遭环绕 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(在倾注光芒的风暴之中)</span></text><text for="L42">而我负意前行 撕裂天穹 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(抵挡黑夜的降临)</span></text><text for="L43">风潮愈烈 我们已决意抗争到底</text><text for="L44">我们会找到出路</text><text for="L45">我会找到出路</text><text for="L46">穿越风暴之眼</text><text for="L47">无惧风暴</text><text for="L48">让世界重塑</text><text for="L49">在世界尽头</text><text for="L50">看鸢尾绽放</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="36076482"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="amatke31"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Against the Tide"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Against the Tide"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="鸣潮先约电台"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Forts"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Obadiah Brown-Beach"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2709131641"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0039rmgI02XQmw"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="0iNf5PLeDpBIrr9yBCprCR"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1817076274"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="HKG732541765"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:04.441" end="4:28.025"><p begin="0:04.441" end="0:08.483" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:04.441" end="0:04.929">As</span> <span begin="0:04.929" end="0:05.639">whispers</span> <span begin="0:05.639" end="0:06.070">ride</span> <span begin="0:06.070" end="0:06.337">the</span> <span begin="0:06.337" end="0:06.883">wind</span> <span begin="0:06.883" end="0:07.267">in</span> <span begin="0:07.267" end="0:07.603">my</span> <span begin="0:07.603" end="0:08.483">ears</span></p><p begin="0:09.899" end="0:13.579" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.899" end="0:10.350">Dusk</span> <span begin="0:10.350" end="0:10.651">has</span> <span begin="0:10.651" end="0:11.036">brought</span> <span begin="0:11.036" end="0:11.291">the</span> <span begin="0:11.291" end="0:11.644">dawn</span> <span begin="0:11.644" end="0:12.027">of</span> <span begin="0:12.027" end="0:12.412">my</span> <span begin="0:12.412" end="0:13.579">fears</span></p><p begin="0:14.687" end="0:18.849" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.687" end="0:14.946">The</span> <span begin="0:14.946" end="0:15.471">gale</span> <span begin="0:15.471" end="0:15.983">devoured</span> <span begin="0:15.983" end="0:16.256">the</span> <span begin="0:16.256" end="0:16.914">heavens</span> <span begin="0:16.914" end="0:17.312">and</span> <span begin="0:17.312" end="0:17.583">the</span> <span begin="0:17.583" end="0:18.849">light</span></p><p begin="0:19.846" end="0:24.605" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.846" end="0:20.421">Enshrined</span> <span begin="0:20.421" end="0:20.629">in</span> <span begin="0:20.629" end="0:21.125">shadow</span> <span begin="0:21.125" end="0:21.301">a</span> <span begin="0:21.301" end="0:21.702">tomb</span> <span begin="0:21.702" end="0:22.152">built</span> <span begin="0:22.152" end="0:22.518">of</span> <span begin="0:22.518" end="0:24.605">night</span></p><p begin="0:24.605" end="0:29.263" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.605" end="0:25.331">Strike</span> <span begin="0:25.331" end="0:25.596">my</span> <span begin="0:25.596" end="0:25.957">blade</span> <span begin="0:25.957" end="0:26.303">in</span> <span begin="0:26.303" end="0:26.878">rhythm</span> <span begin="0:26.878" end="0:27.183">with</span> <span begin="0:27.183" end="0:27.582">the</span> <span begin="0:27.582" end="0:29.263">storm</span></p><p begin="0:29.573" end="0:34.532" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.573" end="0:30.325">Entwined</span> <span begin="0:30.325" end="0:30.660">by</span> <span begin="0:30.660" end="0:31.140">fate</span> <span begin="0:31.140" end="0:31.941">summon</span> <span begin="0:31.941" end="0:32.436">the</span> <span begin="0:32.436" end="0:32.948">ashen</span> <span begin="0:32.948" end="0:34.532">swarm</span></p><p begin="0:34.799" end="0:39.085" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.799" end="0:35.024">If</span> <span begin="0:35.024" end="0:35.632">freedom</span> <span begin="0:35.632" end="0:36.015">must</span> <span begin="0:36.015" end="0:36.319">be</span> <span begin="0:36.319" end="0:36.751">wrought</span> <span begin="0:36.751" end="0:37.215">by</span> <span begin="0:37.215" end="0:39.085">waves</span></p><p begin="0:39.085" end="0:44.159" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.085" end="0:39.787">Let</span> <span begin="0:39.787" end="0:40.012">this</span> <span begin="0:40.012" end="0:40.675">crown</span> <span begin="0:40.675" end="0:41.030">melt</span> <span begin="0:41.030" end="0:41.292">to</span> <span begin="0:41.292" end="0:41.792">dust</span> <span begin="0:41.792" end="0:42.190">and</span> <span begin="0:42.190" end="0:42.306">be</span> <span begin="0:42.306" end="0:42.991">carried</span> <span begin="0:42.991" end="0:44.159">away</span></p><p begin="0:44.368" end="0:48.944" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.368" end="0:44.560">So</span> <span begin="0:44.560" end="0:44.735">let</span> <span begin="0:44.735" end="0:44.960">the</span> <span begin="0:44.960" end="0:45.584">gale</span> <span begin="0:45.584" end="0:46.912">become</span> <span begin="0:46.912" end="0:47.519">one</span> <span begin="0:47.519" end="0:48.096">with</span> <span begin="0:48.096" end="0:48.944">me</span></p><p begin="0:49.474" end="0:53.970" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.474" end="0:49.953">Follow</span> <span begin="0:49.953" end="0:50.738">me</span> <span begin="0:50.738" end="0:51.170">the</span> <span begin="0:51.170" end="0:51.842">dawn</span> <span begin="0:51.842" end="0:52.401">will</span> <span begin="0:52.401" end="0:53.970">rise</span></p><p begin="0:54.392" end="0:59.325" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.392" end="0:54.600">As</span> <span begin="0:54.600" end="0:54.919">they</span> <span begin="0:54.919" end="0:55.593">kneel</span> <span begin="0:55.593" end="0:56.936">before</span> <span begin="0:56.936" end="0:57.512">their</span> <span begin="0:57.512" end="0:59.325">deity</span></p><p begin="0:59.325" end="1:03.768" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.325" end="0:59.733">I</span> <span begin="0:59.733" end="0:59.974">will</span> <span begin="0:59.974" end="1:00.832">fight</span> <span begin="1:00.832" end="1:01.112">to</span> <span begin="1:01.112" end="1:01.880">turn</span> <span begin="1:01.880" end="1:02.392">the</span> <span begin="1:02.392" end="1:03.768">tide</span></p><p begin="1:06.017" end="1:08.039" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.017" end="1:06.242">And</span> <span begin="1:06.242" end="1:06.704">rage</span> <span begin="1:06.704" end="1:07.280">against</span> <span begin="1:07.280" end="1:07.696">the</span> <span begin="1:07.696" end="1:08.039">night</span></p><p begin="1:07.504" end="1:15.153" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.504" end="1:08.035">The</span> <span begin="1:08.035" end="1:08.828">air</span> <span begin="1:08.828" end="1:10.732">enfolds</span> <span begin="1:10.732" end="1:11.879">around</span> <span begin="1:11.879" end="1:12.794">me</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:12.389" end="1:15.153"><span begin="1:12.389" end="1:12.723">(as</span> <span begin="1:12.723" end="1:12.828">a</span> <span begin="1:12.828" end="1:13.706">tempest</span> <span begin="1:13.706" end="1:14.091">rife</span> <span begin="1:14.091" end="1:14.426">with</span> <span begin="1:14.426" end="1:15.153">light)</span></span></p><p begin="1:14.659" end="1:21.236" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.659" end="1:14.803">I'll</span> <span begin="1:14.803" end="1:15.157">go</span> <span begin="1:15.157" end="1:15.700">and</span> <span begin="1:15.700" end="1:16.291">I'll</span> <span begin="1:16.291" end="1:17.093">open</span> <span begin="1:17.093" end="1:17.426">up</span> <span begin="1:17.426" end="1:17.748">the</span> <span begin="1:17.748" end="1:19.524">skies</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:19.639" end="1:21.236"><span begin="1:19.639" end="1:20.067">(to</span> <span begin="1:20.067" end="1:20.259">rage</span> <span begin="1:20.259" end="1:20.852">against</span> <span begin="1:20.852" end="1:21.060">the</span> <span begin="1:21.060" end="1:21.236">night)</span></span></p><p begin="1:20.743" end="1:27.108" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.743" end="1:21.075">As</span> <span begin="1:21.075" end="1:21.230">the</span> <span begin="1:21.230" end="1:22.131">gale</span> <span begin="1:22.131" end="1:22.707">grows</span> <span begin="1:22.707" end="1:22.947">I</span> <span begin="1:22.947" end="1:23.635">bellow</span> <span begin="1:23.635" end="1:24.495">a</span> <span begin="1:24.495" end="1:25.411">fervent</span> <span begin="1:25.411" end="1:26.100">battle</span> <span begin="1:26.100" end="1:27.108">cry</span></p><p begin="1:27.121" end="1:32.529" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.121" end="1:27.281">I'll</span> <span begin="1:27.281" end="1:27.473">find</span> <span begin="1:27.473" end="1:27.777">our</span> <span begin="1:27.777" end="1:28.594">way</span> <span begin="1:28.594" end="1:29.569">out</span> <span begin="1:29.569" end="1:30.225">right</span> <span begin="1:30.225" end="1:30.834">through</span> <span begin="1:30.834" end="1:31.122">the</span> <span begin="1:31.122" end="1:32.529">eye</span></p><p begin="1:32.683" end="1:34.945" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.683" end="1:32.923">The</span> <span begin="1:32.923" end="1:34.012">eye</span> <span begin="1:34.012" end="1:34.347">of</span> <span begin="1:34.347" end="1:34.667">the</span